# 052 · More target drivers

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [later](../roadmap.md#later)

## What

Target drivers for things that are not a CPU or a GPU, such as a board on a serial port or a remote service.

## Why

Not every measurement runs on a CPU or a GPU.

## Done when

- [ ] At least one new driver passes the judge's acceptance tests.

## Decisions

- 2026-10-14, owner: Not all of the work will be GPU measurements. Some will measure a different kind of resource.

## Open questions

None.

## Progress

- 2026-10-19: Goal written from the roadmap.

